            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle PARENT="textBodyPoster" ALIGN="0" CPARENT="textBodiesPoster"/>
                <ITEXT FONTSIZE="30" CH="1 - There is standing genetic and phenotypic variation in current tree flora of Central Europe to allow for adaptation to the rapidly shifting selective pressures from climate change."/>
